    },
    {
      "segment_id": "S00012",
      "start_char": 2284,
      "end_char": 2472,
      "text": "decline with market prices and subsidies are expected to be substantially smaller in 2023.\nSubsidies themselves are enshrined in the law by Presidential decree and their size is currently\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "S00013",
      "start_char": 2472,
      "end_char": 2660,
      "text": "determined by a methodology outlined in 2019.1 Under this methodology, shadow prices for\ndifferent fuels are constructed. Where the actual fuel price exceeds that of the shadow price, the\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "S00014",
      "start_char": 2660,
      "end_char": 2850,
      "text": "relevant excise rate is adjusted downwards to close the gap. Shadow prices are constructed using\nfour components. First, a base price component is set at the fuel price as of November 2018,\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "S00015",
      "start_char": 2850,
      "end_char": 3034,
      "text": "uprated with inflation every 15 days. A second component is a reference price that tracks\ncontemporaneous trends in commodity markets - this is based on the U.S. Gulf Coast waterborne\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "S00016",
      "start_char": 3034,
      "end_char": 3237,
      "text": "ticker. Finally, a transport cost component tracks trends in the cost of transporting fuel and a tax\ncomponent is added to control for taxation. All-in-all, the formula aims to ensure that shadow prices\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "S00017",
      "start_char": 3237,
      "end_char": 3428,
      "text": "track relevant trends in the cost of fuel while also attempting to smooth excess upward cost\npressures. Given projected declines in global oil prices and inflation in 2023, shadow prices and\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "S00018",
      "start_char": 3428,
      "end_char": 3648,
      "text": "1 See https://www.dof.gob.mx/nota_detalle.php?codigo=5583176&fecha=31/12/2019#gsc.tab=0 for the fuel pricing\nformula. The Presidential decree establishes that the statutory excise rate be suspended and fuel subsidies be\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "S00019",
      "start_char": 3648,
      "end_char": 3740,
      "text": "implemented where actual fuel prices exceed the shadow price.\n70 INTERNATIONAL MONETARY FUND"
